      "content": {
        "title": "Your best work is hiding in your camera roll",
        "hook": "Your camera roll knows the job happened. The customer searching your name does not.",
        "angle": "Turn each finished job into visible proof with a repeatable before-during-after photo habit.",
        "caption": "Word of mouth may put your name in someone’s phone.\n\nThen your public record has to back it up.\n\nTry a three-photo habit on every job:\n\nBefore: one wide shot from a clear angle.\n\nDuring: one detail that shows the work people rarely see.\n\nAfter: the finished work from the original angle.\n\nNothing fancy. No photo shoot. Just a record that lets the work speak after the truck leaves.\n\n#OwnerOperator #TradeCrew #JobsiteProof\n\nSource: https://opsapp.co/journal/word-of-mouth-isnt-a-marketing-plan",
        "cta": "On the next job, take all three shots before you load up.",
        "alt_text": "A five-part instructional carousel showing a simple jobsite photo routine: capture one wide photo before work, one detail during the work, and the finished result from the original angle, then save the set together.",
        "slides": [
          {
            "headline": "Your best work is hiding",
            "body": "Your camera roll knows the job happened.\n\nThe customer searching your name does not.",
            "image_url": "https://ops-app-files-prod.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/blog/1788330467150-c767123c.png",
            "alt_text": "Your best work is hiding"
